# Normalize line endings across the team.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts rewrite every file to CRLF and git reports
# the whole repo as modified — producing enormous phantom diffs and constant
# merge conflicts between Windows and macOS/Linux teammates.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` stores everything as LF in the repository and checks it
# out as LF everywhere. Editors on Windows handle LF fine.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files — never touch these.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.svg  text eol=lf
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
